Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.07,0:00:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：在太空场地中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V与快斗的决斗开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看不见身影的V的 No.怪兽 戴森球。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的攻击完全无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 终于它在我们面前现身了！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）好一个巨大的怪兽啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）这戴森球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是连太阳都能覆盖的宇宙殖民地。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其能力是无敌的……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你的攻击只是白费力气。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.05,0:00:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）不可能 攻击竟然无效……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 戴森球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在有超量素材的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对手的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的攻击之所以无效就是因为这个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但只要知道效果的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果真是这样吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要做的事我全都了如指掌。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:00:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟教你决斗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V是快斗的师父！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆，不，父亲消失之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的家人就四分五裂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}年幼的弟弟们被送进了福利院{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.07,0:01:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我为了查明父亲消失那起事件的真相{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留在了Dr.费卡身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那时，我遇到了你们兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着你们兄弟的身影{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我或许是将自己的兄妹重叠在了你们身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.81,0:01:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想要变强。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.62,0:01:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了获得守护弟弟的力量想要得到。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我才将决斗教给了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 竟然会以这样的形式来战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但 如果你要妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会手下留情！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在想什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球体的攻击力是 2800。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 银河眼的攻击力是3000。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你并不了解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球体更进一步的的能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的能力！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动戴森球体的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）攻击力2800的直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨下这招，快斗就！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡！光子化！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有光属性怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将自己光属性怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升那只怪兽攻击力的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:05:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把对方的直接攻击反过来利用了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的，你的决斗我已经看透了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.41,0:05:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡！太空之门！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地上有戴森球存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将其破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受Dr.菲卡带给你的痛苦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有家人被夺走的仇恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个快斗竟然{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被打得这么落花流水……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个男人的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可怕得毫无破绽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）你的生命值只剩下200了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负已定。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃吧，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是赢不了我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}倒下了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特该怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不需要你来同情！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！笨蛋就给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）什么嘛！游马虽然是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但才不是笨蛋呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真意外啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然会站在快斗那边。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗可是背叛了一马先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是Dr.菲卡的儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）而且最重要的是，他是 No.猎人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗要是活下来的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你迟早也可能会被他猎杀啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我和快斗决斗过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以不管那家伙怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:06:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他都是我的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那是我的目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马先生也很珍视。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那份心意也
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被菲卡博士践踏并背叛了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能原谅吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种人的儿子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当得知所有真相的时候 我……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗：克里斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请等一下 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要去哪 您要去哪。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}废话少说！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要 打倒你回收 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:08:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终究 我们的仇恨 你大概不会明白吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《戴森球…》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效攻击，还能直接攻击…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为这个效果，乍看之下简直无敌。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我有对策。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看到了，戴森球的弱点！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那只怪兽在战斗中的破坏成为可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？什么？怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球能够
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效战斗，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有在有叠放单位的时候才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过快斗使用的魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将戴森球的无敌效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 No.系怪兽只能被 No.系怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏的这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果也被无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原 原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来戴森球就是一堆巨大的废铁了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一手也在我的预料之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 另一个戴森球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为零时被攻击的场合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地让超量素材复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）在这个瞬间 戴森球的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一个效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当有叠放单位存在时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击将会无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}任何人都无法破坏的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的生命值 已经 只剩200了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等下一回合 来了的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放1张 卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法 重力爆裂炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让装备的 怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合一次 提升400点！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且将对方怪兽的效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么不直接攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么V要出这种招……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，你应该明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅仅获胜是不够的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要将你的象征——银河眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎之后才算完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼被……！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.97,0:10:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！镜面护罩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将生命值减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来无效我受到的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行的！根本赢不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快……快斗要输了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.29,0:11:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的生命值是100。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V的生命值毫发无损。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是快斗，这样下去也……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，很难受吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很痛苦吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，已经不用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就在这里从所有的痛苦中解放出来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从 No.猎人的使命中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从哈鲁特的痛苦中……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我能为你做的最后的仁慈了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……从来一次都没有……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把哈鲁特当成我的痛苦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样想过！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙哈鲁特是我的一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我活下去的意义！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙一直在给我希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会放弃的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的事也好，哈鲁特的事也好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊，放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是……这张卡是……！》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这张卡要……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要拯救我吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的命运……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡，对未来的思念！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？那是什么卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连我都不知道的卡，你居然……！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然在你的卡组里……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你对我的手牌有多了解{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的事你不可能知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这张卡是人生中　唯一一张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从老爸那里　得到的　卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的老爸…。　从Dr.费卡那里…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　至今　一次也
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有用过　这张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能…。　憎恨父亲的　你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然把那种卡放进了卡组里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事有可能吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然有啊　这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都想　保护家人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像你们想要保护家人一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.49,0:13:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以快斗也　持有那张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:14:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是自己的家人也有希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}家人的希望…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 快斗是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住口！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的内心不需要你来代言。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡 对未来的思念！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级不同的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤３只！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 光子斩击者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子海盗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 通过这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫无意义啊 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是零！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 等级不同的怪兽又能做什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡 等级提升 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的怪兽等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为最高的怪兽等级！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把所有的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都提升到等级８！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级８的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子斩击者 以及
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子海盗 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻涌的银河啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻化作怒涛之光现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 我的灵魂！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间，场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宇宙 frontiers 的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子咆哮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被超量召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将新银河眼以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 大爆炸恐慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表侧表示的魔法·陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成对方的超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升８００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再使用一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼 效果发动！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将戴森球的所有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元 全部吸收！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每吸收一个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 上升５００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 ６８００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 新银河眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以按照吸收的超量单元数量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我从那时候起就一直 在内心的某处{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要追上你》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 终于…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。 这就是 你的强大吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇的前方只有空虚而已……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我也明白……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V……不……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯托弗·阿克雷特。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被用那个名字称呼已经很久没有过了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.94,0:19:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才是V真正的名字……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和父亲一起舍弃了自己家族的名字……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，我想救父亲……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，从异世界回来的父亲的心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经被对Dr.费卡的复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彻底占据了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我无法阻止它。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这就是亲子关系吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是为了反抗父母而战斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天等哈鲁特的事情解决之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要亲手和Dr.费卡做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经变得这么强了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的意志，由我来继承。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会替你跟托隆做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们其实是我真正的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弟弟……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.63,0:20:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一个舞台，我也一定会。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧，轨道7！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵……遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是喷流灵的功能坏了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎……被盯上了……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在马上进行应急处理……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请等3秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1 2 3。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}睡吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆和Dr.费卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.85,0:21:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当他们两人开始行动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我被送进了这个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.56,0:21:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 那就是在星光体世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你父亲的意志！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸是让我和你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把托隆和Dr.费卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:21:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阻止掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:21:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干吧！ 我一定干！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.06,0:22:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要狠狠地给他们点颜色看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对那些自私自利的大人们！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.79,0:23:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.14,0:23:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.33,0:23:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.29,0:24:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.42,0:24:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能打倒戴森球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.04,0:24:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太牛了啊，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.06,0:24:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过下次战斗的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗会使用
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.85,0:24:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球的意思吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗果然是最强的敌人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.49,0:24:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也不能输啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.35,0:24:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！

